WEBVTT

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:07.960
I love you!

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:12.210
Do you know the legend?

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:18.540
They say if you become a couple under the cherry tree,
you'll share an eternal bond.

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:24.420
Um...

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:25.790
Uh, s-sorry.

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:29.040
I was too surprised to take in any of that.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.330
Um...

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.830
What was that about the cherry tree?

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.080
Could you start again, please?

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.330
From the beginning, you mean?

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:45.380
I'm in love!

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:48.790
Um, by "in love"...

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:50.380
You mean with going com-

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:51.080
Yes!

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:53.790
O-oh, right...

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:57.710
Is it... kind of exhilarating, would you say?

00:00:57.710 --> 00:00:59.420
Of course it is!

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:01.750
For a girl, this type of thing...

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:04.420
is really thrilling.

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:07.290
But is it a good kind of thrill?

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:09.540
Oh, right.

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:10.920
I don't think I dislike it.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:14.170
So!

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.630
Well...

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:18.130
How do you feel?

00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:21.000
Uh, well, let me see...

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.040
I've never really thought about it.

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:25.880
I might have to try it out first and see.

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:29.000
Oh, really?

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.080
Oh, but I'm not saying I'm against it!

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.330
I figure we all have our own
pleasures and predilections.

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:36.130
Pleasures? Predilections?

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:38.290
You like not wearing anything, right?

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:39.380
Down there.

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:42.380
"Down there"? What are you...

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:46.290
I-it's not like that!

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:47.710
I was just nervous and forgot!

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:49.960
No, wait! I'm not saying I forgot altogether!

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:51.380
I was wearing some, but now I'm not!

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:52.500
I lost them!

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:54.420
Jeez, why am I babbling like this?

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.540
The point is, it's not like that!

00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:01.460
Most likely, the ones you lost... are those, right?

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:03.080
Oh, sorry!

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:04.880
They got blown away by the wind just now.

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:07.420
I picked them up this morning after our collision.

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:09.790
N-NO!

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:13.130
It's not like that!

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:16.460
What was all that about?

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:53.630
I'm in love!

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:56.380
She made it sound so serious.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:01.000
Is it really that great?

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:04.630
Woof!

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:07.960
Dogs scary! Dogs scary! Dogs scary!

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:08.750
Um...

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.080
Woof.

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:13.330
You!

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:16.670
Sorry! I didn't think it would be such a big shock.

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:21.380
So, uh... Ilya, right?

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:22.330
Yes.

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:25.080
Well? You need me for something?

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:27.040
Oh. Yes.

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:29.960
You see, I... Well...

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.380
Is it hard to talk about?

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:37.000
Um, kind of.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:38.670
Come on.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:41.040
If you won't tell me, I'm not going to stick around.

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:42.670
Asahi!

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:44.000
I love you!

00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:48.290
I'm in love with you, Asahi!

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:51.040
H-hold on a sec! "Love"?!

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:52.290
In what sense?

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:56.250
When I think about you,
my heart skips a beat.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.790
That's love, isn't it?

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.880
What are you asking me for?

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:02.830
Why me, anyway?

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:05.460
You sacrificed yourself to save me.

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:07.630
I just got dragged into it. That's all.

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:09.540
Even so, I love you.

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:12.580
Does it... bother you?

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:16.830
No, that's not what I'm...

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:20.170
Mr. Kashiwagi!

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:23.000
Teach, what's the big pani-

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.790
Please! Come with me!

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:35.790
In here!

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:37.380
Hey, wait just a...

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:39.420
Hey! Ms. Mongfa!

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:41.380
What the hell's going on?!

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:44.500
I'm sorry. There's no time to explain.

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:46.670
Oh no!

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:47.790
Apologies!

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:48.540
Hey!

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:54.750
That's... a bit too...

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:10.040
T-Teach, who were... I think they're already...

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:14.500
Huh?

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:16.880
Sorry. That must have been quite a shock.

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:18.000
Are you okay?

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:22.000
A shock? An electric shock, more like.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:25.710
Who were those guys?

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:28.960
They were... How should I put it?

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:30.290
Ah, yes. Underlings!

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:31.290
"Underlings"?

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:33.670
There's someone trying to woo me.

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:37.170
They're using their underlings to look for me.

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:40.330
It's a pain, since I don't really like this person.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:42.630
That's why I wanted to throw them off the scent.

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:44.920
I'm sorry. What a nuisance for you.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:47.460
N-no, I wouldn't say that.

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:50.000
But you're only meant
to do that with someone you lo-

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.040
I love you.

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:55.000
I'm in love with you, okay?

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:56.920
U-uh...

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.710
H-hold on a second.

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:00.710
We're teacher and student.

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:03.330
First and foremost, we're a man and a woman.

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.960
I mean... But...

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:05.880
Well?

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:08.540
Don't you like me?

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:11.670
U-uh...

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.380
I...

00:07:14.170 --> 00:07:16.500
I'm sorry!

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:18.750
Oh.

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:21.960
What was that? What was that? What was that?!

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.710
Found you!

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:32.250
Asahi!

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:35.210
What?!

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.460
Hey! You were supposed to catch me!

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:40.960
Jeez!

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:42.960
I don't know her. I don't know her.

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:44.880
Come on! Don't ignore me!

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:46.750
Whoever you are, you're clearly shady.

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:48.420
What do you mean, "shady"?!

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:50.250
I'm today's most talked-about model!

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:52.330
Huh? "Model"?

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:54.920
Now that I think about it,
Yoshio said something like that.

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:56.670
You really don't know?

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:57.500
Look!

00:07:58.380 --> 00:07:59.380
<b>Are you hydrated?</b>

00:07:58.380 --> 00:07:59.380
<b>Karin's Carin' About Thirst!</b>

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.290
Well? Surprised?

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:04.500
I guess.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:07.170
Oh, I see. So that outfit's for a photo shoot?

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:08.420
Don't be silly.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.170
It's because I'm on the way to my wedding.

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:12.670
"Wedding"?

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:16.250
Got it. Congrats.

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:17.290
Thanks!

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:18.580
All the best!

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:19.420
Bye.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:20.830
Hold it right there.

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:21.790
What now?

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:24.250
Stop fooling around.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:26.210
Don't tell me this wedding...

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:27.130
Yup!

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:29.960
It's for me... and you!

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:35.080
Eek, eek, eek, eek, eek, eek!

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:37.080
Is "why?" an acceptable question?

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:38.830
Why do you think?

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:43.880
It's because... I'm - in - love - with - you.

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.130
So, let's go!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:48.790
Wait. Go where?

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.500
Where do you think?

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:54.380
Here.

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:56.250
Aren't you skipping a few steps?!

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:57.290
Am I?

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:03.750
All right. But first, let's say our vows.

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:05.170
You'll do it?

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:09.080
What guy wouldn't be happy to get
a marriage proposal from a popular model?

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:10.290
Yay!

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:12.790
Asahi...

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:15.380
Could you close your eyes for me?

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:16.250
Okay.

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:20.420
I'm finally tying the knot with my special someone!

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:22.750
Hey, Asahi. I'm still waiting.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:26.040
Don't keep me in suspense.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.540
Come on, Asahi.

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:34.210
This is all so weird.
Totally different from this morning.

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:35.790
What's going on?

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.170
Signatures, please.

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:40.920
Any signatures will be much appreciated.

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:44.210
Do you have a minute?
I'd like to get your signature.

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:45.920
Sorry. I'm in a hurry.

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:48.540
W-wait. All I need is your name.

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:50.250
I told you, I'm-

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:52.380
It'll really only take the briefest little moment.

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:53.460
Please.

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:57.040
There we go. Just write your name. Okay?

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:59.630
Yup. Keep going.

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:01.670
Your full name, nice and quick.

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:02.250
<b>Write your name in here</b>

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:02.250
<b>Groom</b>

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:02.960
<b>Marriage Registration</b>

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:05.210
This is a marriage form!

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:08.290
Aww. And I was so close.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:09.580
You too?

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:10.920
What the hell?!

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:13.500
I'm not even old enough to get married!

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.670
The age thing'll work itself out.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:16.420
Like hell it will!

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:17.630
You're all pranking me, right?

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:19.250
Collecting trash. Collecting.
You're all pranking me, right?<b></b>

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:20.920
Collecting trash. Collecting.
Not at all. It's serious.<b></b>

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:23.580
This is dumb. I've had enough.

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:24.540
Hey, wait! Hold it!

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:25.790
Trash has been sighted.
Hey, wait! Hold it!<b></b>

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:26.880
Trash has been sighted.

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:29.330
No way. Not again.

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:31.330
Collecting. Collecting.

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:32.670
H-hey!

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:34.960
Stop that! I'll bash you to bits!

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:37.130
Collecting unnecessary item.

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:38.670
Collecting.
How did you get that off me so easily?!<b></b>

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:39.580
Collecting unnecessary item.
How did you get that off me so easily?!<b></b>

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:41.250
Collecting unnecessary item.
Give it back! Give it back!<b></b>

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:42.330
Give it back! Give it back!

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:46.460
Good grief. Seriously, what's up with this?

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:50.040
Has the whole world suddenly gone into heat?

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:52.330
I'm ho-

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:57.920
Welcome home, dear.

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:00.920
Love Flops.

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:07.960
Welcome home, dear.

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:09.330
<b>MATSUTAKE</b>

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:09.670
Welcome home!

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:15.420
Welcome home, dear.

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:17.330
Welcome home!

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:18.630
Do you want dinner?

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:19.670
Or a bath?

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:21.580
Or how about... me?

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:22.830
Hey!

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:25.000
Why'd you close the door?!

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.080
Sorry. I have the wrong house.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:29.500
Nope. This is your house.

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:31.960
Then what are you all doing here?

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.040
Huh?

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.750
You mean you didn't hear?

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:37.750
You've received a message.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:39.000
From who?

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.500
Your dad.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:42.330
Read it out.

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:48.580
"If you're receiving this message,
that means everyone's arrived, Asahi."

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:49.500
Dad...

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:54.250
"To cut to the chase, these five
are all potential brides for you."

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:54.210
<b>Playing</b>

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:55.420
"Brides"?

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:59.130
"What do you think? All pretty hot, right, you perv?"

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:00.580
Don't be stupid. Besides-

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:03.420
"Now, I bet you want to point out
that one of them's a guy.

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:04.250
Listen.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:09.040
As your dad, I believe that in this era, there's no
need to limit yourself based on gender.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:13.000
Anyway, you'll all be living together
starting today."

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:13.540
Huh?!

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:17.170
"Based on that, you can choose one,
or not choose any of them.

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.540
That's up to you."

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:20.330
Slow down! "Together"?!

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:23.710
"One rule I do want to lay down:
don't have any kids yet, okay?

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:24.420
Bye."

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:26.290
Hey! You can't just say that!

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:29.130
Dude, it's just a message. It can't hear you.

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:31.960
That about covers it. Starting today...

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:34.290
We look forward to living here.

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:38.170
You must be hungry. I'll make dinner.

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:39.460
What would you like?

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:41.880
No fair, making yourself stand out!

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:44.000
I-I can make dessert!

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:45.920
And you, Ilya! Stop showing off.

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:47.380
That wasn't my intent!

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:49.290
Why don't we all make dinner together?

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:53.130
First things first.
After a long day, you must want a bath.

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:55.040
I'll give you a massage.

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:56.830
Teach, don't get in the way!

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:57.830
H-hey...

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:59.670
I'm not in the way, right?

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:01.750
Let me handle this!

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:02.460
Wait... I...

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:05.170
Hold it! No fair, stealing a march on me!

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:06.080
I'll join in too!

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:07.880
I'll massage you too, if you like.

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:08.420
Me too!

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:09.670
I was first!

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:11.790
This needs an older woman's touch.

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:13.250
Don't you agree, Asahi?

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:14.710
I'll do it! Me! Karin!

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.040
I can do it as well.

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:16.750
And me!

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:20.710
It's not right for me to live with this
many girls under one roof.

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:21.500
GAH!

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:23.170
Cut it out already!

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:32.750
What do you mean, "leave"?

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:36.170
Look, my dad arranged all this on his own.

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:37.710
It had nothing to do with me.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:42.210
Kicking us out straight away
because of that feels a little tyrannical to me.

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:43.420
Yeah! Exactly!

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:47.290
Besides, if you throw us out,
we have nowhere else to go.

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:49.750
Where have you been staying
since you got to Japan?

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:51.420
In a hotel, obviously.

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:53.580
Then you can go back there, can't you?

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:56.290
It's not like my house
even has space for five extra people.

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:57.790
There are enough rooms, though.

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:58.420
Huh?

00:13:58.420 --> 00:13:59.920
The second floor has six rooms.

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:01.670
No, it only has three roo-

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:10.960
What the hell?!

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:13.830
Pretty dope, huh? What's the problem?

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.040
Everything!

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:18.130
See? So we can all happily live here.

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:20.460
I-it's not just about space.

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.040
Then what is it about?

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:24.000
I'm a guy.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:27.170
I shouldn't be living
with so many girls under one roof.

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.540
I'm a guy too.

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:31.420
The point is, it's not right!

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:33.830
We're your potential brides. It's fine, surely.

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:35.460
What if something happens?!

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:37.880
Oh, so you're saying something might happen.

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:39.580
N-no, I meant...

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:41.500
Like, in the unlikely event...

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.710
Personally, I wouldn't mind if something happened!

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:45.080
I wouldn't either!

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:46.290
O-or me!

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:49.710
The school wouldn't approve, right?

00:14:50.170 --> 00:14:53.540
That should all be okay. I got permission.

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:56.580
What is wrong with that school?

00:14:56.920 --> 00:14:59.130
No, no, no. It's still not okay.

00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:00.830
Absolutely not.

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:03.170
Why are you so insistent?

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:06.330
Are you saying... you don't like us?

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:08.460
N-no, it's not like that.

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:11.500
Please! Let us stay here!

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:13.000
It's not that simple.

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:14.290
Asahi.

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:15.040
Asahi.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:15.710
Asahi.

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:16.880
Asahi.

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:18.210
Asahi.

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:26.790
Whoa. Did you make all this?

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:28.500
What can I say?

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:30.460
Aoi made most of it, didn't she?

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:32.210
I helped. I set the table.

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:34.000
Let's just say we made it together.

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:37.540
Anyway, go on. Let's dig in before it gets cold.

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:41.290
Bon appétit!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.330
How is it?

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:46.750
Super yummy.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:47.670
What a relief.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:49.250
Here! Say "ah"!

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:51.630
Hey, no fair! Me too, me too!

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:52.540
H-hey...

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:53.670
A-and me!

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:54.460
Oh my.

00:15:54.460 --> 00:15:56.040
Here you go, Asahi.
Here. Say "ah."<b></b>

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:56.880
GAH!

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:58.330
I can feed myself!

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:02.290
Are you done?

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:03.380
Not quite.

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:05.960
Here you go.

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:07.540
R-right, thanks.

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:10.380
Hope you don't mind if I sit next to you.

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:11.210
H-hey...

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:13.040
Thank you very much.

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:15.080
For not throwing us out.

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:19.380
Well... As long as you don't cause me any...

00:16:21.630 --> 00:16:22.830
What's wrong?

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:23.710
N-nothing!

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:24.960
Thanks for waiting!

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:27.380
I made banana bread.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:29.420
Whew.

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:31.670
Here. Say "ah."

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:34.170
I-I'm gonna go take a bath!

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:37.670
Oh, a bath?

00:16:37.670 --> 00:16:38.500
Yeah.

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:39.670
Hmm...

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:45.210
Seriously, what are you doing?

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:48.210
Hey.

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:51.710
What a coincidence.
I was thinking of taking a bath too.

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:01.670
What do I do?

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:16.170
What are you doing? I couldn't breathe!

00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:17.710
No, what are you doing?!

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:18.880
Get out right now!

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:21.040
I was here first, wasn't I?

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:23.330
Jeez!

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:24.250
H-hey!

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:25.710
What are you standing up for?!

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:27.710
You literally just told me to get out!

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:29.750
But you don't want me looking at you!

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:33.790
I-if it's you, I don't really mind.

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:34.580
Huh?!

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:36.130
N-nothing!

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:37.710
I'm not getting out, okay?

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:38.960
Why, you...

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:41.130
Suit yourself.

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:48.080
I can't even take a bath in peace.

00:17:57.170 --> 00:17:58.710
Guess I'm overthinking it.

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:00.040
They wouldn't go that far.

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:04.920
Leave me alone!

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:10.170
I told you not to cause me any hassle, didn't I?

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:12.420
You don't have to be this angry.

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:13.460
Amelia.

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:15.080
We're sorry.

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:16.210
I'm past caring.

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:17.420
So you forgive us?

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:20.170
I'm past caring, so just get out.

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:21.460
Oh no!

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:24.960
We told you. We have nowhere else to go.

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:27.330
Oh, that's right.

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:29.790
Got it. Then there's no choice.

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.960
Wh-where are you going?

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:35.460
If you won't leave, I will.

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:37.420
S-stop, wait a second! We apologize!

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:41.880
Saying that is one thing, but where do I go?

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:09.330
So there's a place like this nearby.

00:19:10.130 --> 00:19:12.460
I'm impressed you found me.

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:17.630
I just had a feeling
you were somewhere in this direction.

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:18.830
What?

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:23.420
I spent so long wondering what you'd be like.

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:27.250
Our special someone.

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:29.210
You didn't even know who I was?

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:30.500
Just your name.

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:32.880
The rest had to wait until we met you.

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:35.920
Seriously? That's taking liberties.

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:38.290
But you know... It was exciting.

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:42.670
Imagining what kind of person
was waiting for us.

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:45.170
<b>Please have some</b>

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:45.170
<b>if you get peckish</b>

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:45.210
Believing that he was our destiny -

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:47.750
that he'd change our lives.

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:52.330
My heart was racing with a teeny bit of anxiety
and lots of anticipation.

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:56.000
That might be why all of us, me included,
went a little too far.

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:01.630
I'm sorry. Please come home.

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:04.960
If you don't want us there, we'll leave.

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:08.960
You have nowhere else, right?

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:10.500
It'll be fine.

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:13.830
I'm sure we'll manage somehow.

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:22.170
Um...

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:25.710
Okay. It's fine.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:28.330
You can stay at my house.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.380
But...

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:32.830
I can't throw girls out on the street
at this hour, right?

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:35.000
Are you sure?

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:36.210
But in exchange...

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:38.380
No more messing around like today!

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:41.540
Um... We'll do our utmost.

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:44.040
Then we're all good.

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:55.040
What... was...

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:58.040
I'm sorry! I don't know what's wrong with me.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:01.170
Are you okay?

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:03.630
I should apologize too. Sorry.

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:05.380
It's nothing you did.

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:07.790
Let's head back.

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:09.710
To the others.

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:14.710
You haven't left anything, right?

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:16.000
I'm ready.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:17.330
Ready.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:19.460
Shall we go, then?

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:20.630
Yes, ma'am.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:23.250
Good grief.

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:26.420
Where are you going?
You have nowhere else to stay.

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:27.920
Asahi...

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:30.080
It's fine. You don't have to leave.

00:21:30.710 --> 00:21:31.790
You mean...

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:35.040
Just... no more acting like that.

00:21:35.420 --> 00:21:36.540
Asahi!

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:40.790
Welcome home!

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:46.040
Yeah. I'm home.

00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:52.210
And so began our wacky life together.

00:21:53.630 --> 00:21:55.080
Chop-chop.

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:26.210
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:26.920
Finished!

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:28.670
<b>Asahi</b>

00:23:26.920 --> 00:23:27.500
Um...

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:28.420
That's... my name, right?

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:29.670
Just kidding!
That's... my name, right?<b></b>

00:23:29.670 --> 00:23:31.170
No... Not there...

00:23:31.170 --> 00:23:31.830
What are they doing?

00:23:31.830 --> 00:23:32.830
I can't see from here.
What are they doing?<b></b>

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:33.830
There's more than one thing a man
and woman could be doing together.

00:23:33.830 --> 00:23:35.500
Next time, episode 3:
There's more than one thing a man<b>
</b>and woman could be doing together.<b></b>

00:23:35.500 --> 00:23:38.330
"No! Not There! Not Like That!"

00:23:35.540 --> 00:23:40.380
<b>No! Not There! Not Like That!</b>

00:23:38.330 --> 00:23:40.130
Is it okay to snooze the alarm?
